From f8f5ac75fb754da0d0ed3f6b0bb71a697373c49f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Matheus Sampaio Queiroga <srherobrine20@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 11 Aug 2026 18:56:03 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] net: airoha: Add support for EcoNet EN751221/EN7521 xPON

Extend the Airoha xPON driver and DT bindings to support EcoNet
EN751221,
EN7521, and EN7526 SoCs. These devices share the xPON MAC complex logic
but utilize a different register masking scheme for SCU mode selection
and route MAC interrupts through the WAN QDMA aggregator rather than
exposing them as dedicated platform IRQs.

Signed-off-by: Matheus Sampaio Queiroga <srherobrine20@gmail.com>
---
